 | An EID — or Entity ID — is a 4-byte sequence used to identify a specific entity. An entity's EID is unique on the entire server. The same entity is not guaranteed to always have the same EID. The EID is set every time an entity appears on a world, so it is recomputed every time the entity changes dimension, gets unloaded and re-loaded, etc.
